    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan are proud to present this truly exceptional detached family residence extending to approximately 3,541 sq. ft., occupying a magnificent 0.52-acre landscaped site in the highly sought-after location of Ballymorris, Cratloe. \n\nPerfectly positioned within walking distance of Cratloe Village and just minutes from Limerick City, this outstanding home offers the rare combination of countryside tranquillity, exceptional privacy, and unrivalled convenience. Designed and finished to an exceptional standard throughout, the property provides luxurious accommodation ideally suited to modern family living.\n\nFrom the moment you arrive, the home's impressive stone façade, mature landscaped grounds, and sweeping driveway create an immediate sense of quality and distinction. The beautifully maintained gardens surrounding the property have been thoughtfully designed and meticulously cared for, providing a stunning outdoor setting that complements the scale and elegance of the residence.\n\nThe accommodation is both extensive and beautifully proportioned. A welcoming entrance hall leads to a formal dining room, a spacious main reception room, and a magnificent conservatory featuring elegant marble flooring and enjoying views over the landscaped gardens. At the heart of the home lies a superb open-plan kitchen and dining area complete with a large central island, creating the perfect space for both everyday family life and entertaining. The kitchen is further complemented by a substantial utility room and guest WC. Downstairs is completed with a home office/bedroom, which also benefits from an ensuite. \n\nThe first floor accommodation is equally impressive, comprising four generously proportioned double bedrooms, each benefiting from its own private en-suite bathroom and fully fitted walk in wardrobes. The luxurious master suite offers a true retreat, featuring a walk-thru dressing room, private sauna, double vanity unit, jacuzzi bath, and a beautifully appointed en-suite bathroom designed with comfort and relaxation in mind. A spacious family bathroom serves the remainder of the first floor accommodation.\n\nA number of premium features further enhance this exceptional property, including three-phase electricity, a fully monitored alarm system, a central vacuum system, laundry chute, gas-fired heating system, extensive storage, and a large double-door garage offering excellent parking, storage, or workshop potential.\n\nTo the rear, the property continues to impress with a substantial decking area and an elevated balcony overlooking the beautifully landscaped gardens and surrounding countryside. These outdoor spaces provide the perfect setting for entertaining, dining al fresco, or simply enjoying the peaceful surroundings and spectacular views.\n\nProperties of this calibre rarely come to the market. Combining generous proportions, outstanding craftsmanship, luxurious features, and an exceptional location, Ballymorris represents a unique opportunity to acquire one of Cratloe's finest family homes. \n\nViewing is strictly by appointment and is highly recommended to fully appreciate everything this remarkable residence has to offer."
      },
